WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:10.580
Muffy is my dog.

2
00:00:10.581 --> 00:00:13.603
She is furry and white.

3
00:00:13.604 --> 00:00:17.538
"How cute!"

4
00:00:17.539 --> 00:00:24.052
Muffy likes to play all around the house.

5
00:00:24.053 --> 00:00:29.127
"Don't go outside again!"

6
00:00:29.128 --> 00:00:33.256
On Monday, I opened the door for my friend.

7
00:00:33.257 --> 00:00:41.448
"Stop, Muffy!" I said, but Muffy ran away.

8
00:00:41.449 --> 00:00:45.956
"Mom, Muffy is gone!" I said.

9
00:00:45.957 --> 00:00:50.753
Mom thought Muffy was at the park.

10
00:00:50.754 --> 00:00:52.670
We went to the park.

11
00:00:52.671 --> 00:00:56.920
But Muffy was not at the park.

12
00:00:56.921 --> 00:01:00.485
Sometimes Muffy played with Mr. Smith.

13
00:01:00.486 --> 00:01:06.011
But Muffy was not at Mr. Smith's house.

14
00:01:06.012 --> 00:01:08.715
Mom called the animal shelter.

15
00:01:08.716 --> 00:01:13.541
But Muffy was not there either.

16
00:01:13.542 --> 00:01:17.516
"Muffy is really gone!" I said.

17
00:01:17.517 --> 00:01:22.263
Mom and I made a poster together.

18
00:01:22.264 --> 00:01:26.667
We put Muffy's picture on the poster.

19
00:01:26.668 --> 00:01:30.140
We put the posters everywhere.

20
00:01:30.141 --> 00:01:35.148
We put a poster in the grocery store too.

21
00:01:35.149 --> 00:01:38.635
It was Tuesday, then it was Wednesday.

22
00:01:38.636 --> 00:01:41.940
No one called about Muffy.

23
00:01:41.941 --> 00:01:47.677
On Thursday the phone rang. Ring ring!

24
00:01:47.678 --> 00:01:50.163
"Hello, I saw the poster.

25
00:01:50.164 --> 00:01:52.703
I have your dog."

26
00:01:52.704 --> 00:01:56.824
On Friday, a man drove a car to our house.

27
00:01:56.825 --> 00:01:59.474
Muffy was in the car.

28
00:01:59.475 --> 00:02:03.593
"Mom, there is Muffy!" I said.

29
00:02:03.594 --> 00:02:05.260
I'm so happy.

30
00:02:05.261 --> 00:02:07.326
Muffy is home!

31
00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:13.922
"Muffy, don't run away again!"
